        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Standing seam metal roofing is the overall best roofing material for Utah\u2019s climate, offering a 40-to-70-year lifespan, superior snow-shedding capabilities, and high wind resistance. For a budget-friendly alternative, Class 4 impact-resistant architectural asphalt shingles provide the best balance of hail protection and value.",
